   3:Source/ui/error_page.c ****  * Error page display (port of Source/ui/error_page.lua). See error_page.h.
   4:Source/ui/error_page.c ****  * Behavior preserved: selection clamped 1..3, left/up decrement, right/down
   5:Source/ui/error_page.c ****  * increment, A activates retry/search/home; draw draws the rounded panel,
   6:Source/ui/error_page.c ****  * truncated message (48) and URL (50), and three 100x28 buttons with the
   7:Source/ui/error_page.c ****  * selected one filled black/inverted.
